{
  "about": "How the terms of the affair schema (`data/schema/docket.json`, described in `data/schema/DEFINITION.md`) are called in OpenParlData and in the standards the challenge names: per term the elements or properties that hold the same thing there, by their names in the standard's own schema; an empty list where none was found. Which element answers a term is a reading of the schemas, set by the assistant on 11 October 2026, open. That every name exists in its schema is checked by `tools/mapping.py`; this page is written from `data/schema/mapping.json`.",
